flowchart LR
    request[/여행 조건/]
    extract[조건 구조화]
    complete{조건 충분?}
    ask[누락 조건 요청]
    marketFilter[시장 개설일 필터]
    placeFilter[주변 장소 필터]
    route[구간 경로 계산]
    rank[코스 점수 계산]
    compose[추천 설명 생성]
    validate{검증 통과?}
    response[코스 최대 3개]
    fallback[캐시 또는 예시 코스]
    logs[(추천 로그)]

    request --> extract
    extract --> complete
    complete -->|아니오| ask
    ask -.-> request
    complete -->|예| marketFilter
    marketFilter --> placeFilter
    placeFilter --> route
    route --> rank
    rank --> compose
    compose --> validate
    validate -->|예| response
    validate -->|아니오| fallback
    response --> logs
    fallback --> logs

    style complete fill:#FFECBD,stroke:#FFC943
    style validate fill:#FFECBD,stroke:#FFC943
    style response fill:#CDF4D3,stroke:#66D575
    style fallback fill:#FFCDC2,stroke:#FF7556

